self.KB_CONTENT["field:757121"]={"id":"field:757121","ty":"field","sourceId":"757121","title":"列印非存貨倉","ver":"iGP","topic":"","keywords":[],"job":"庫存預計狀況表","code":"","answer":"* 庫別的篩選條件。※ 庫存ABC分析表","file":"fields.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["field:777512"]={"id":"field:777512","ty":"field","sourceId":"777512","title":".轉入製令單別","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"","keywords":[],"job":"挪料單建立作業","code":"TR006","answer":"* 可點選(icon)或[F2]製令資料查詢，僅能輸入單據性質為「51.製令工單」或「52.重工工單」者之單別，自動帶出該輸入製令單別之製令單號。但不允許空白。* 變動時清除轉入製令單號。","file":"fields.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["field:781773"]={"id":"field:781773","ty":"field","sourceId":"781773","title":"單位","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"","keywords":[],"job":"料件承認異動","code":"INV.MB004","answer":"* 該品號之品號規格。","file":"fields.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["field:758670"]={"id":"field:758670","ty":"field","sourceId":"758670","title":"規格","ver":"iGP","topic":"","keywords":[],"job":"核價單建立作業","code":"TM006","answer":"* 預設『品號資料建立作業』之資料，若品號設定可修改品名/規格，則本欄位可修改。","file":"fields.jsonl"};
